(ARCHITECTURE AND DESIGN NOTES) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This project is a .NET 9 Web API for Conway's Game of Life. It provides API endpoints,) Tj
T*
(persistent board storage, tests, Swagger for Development, and a small browser UI for) Tj
T*
(demonstration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(HIGH-LEVEL ARCHITECTURE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The application is organized into a few focused areas:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GameOfLife.Api/) Tj
T*
(  Models/) Tj
T*
(    BoardRequests.cs) Tj
T*
(  Services/) Tj
T*
(    BoardValidator.cs) Tj
T*
(    BoardStorageOptions.cs) Tj
T*
(    GameOfLifeEngine.cs) Tj
T*
(    IBoardStore.cs) Tj
T*
(    JsonBoardStore.cs) Tj
T*
(    StoredBoard.cs) Tj
T*
(  wwwroot/) Tj
T*
(    index.html) Tj
T*
(  Program.cs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GameOfLife.Tests/) Tj
T*
(  UnitTest1.cs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`Program.cs` is the API composition layer. It registers dependencies, configures Swagger) Tj
T*
(only for Development, serves the static demo UI, and maps the HTTP endpoints.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`Models/` contains the request and response DTOs used by the API.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`Services/` contains the application logic:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `GameOfLifeEngine` handles Conway's Game of Life rules.) Tj
T*
(- `BoardValidator` validates and normalizes board input.) Tj
T*
(- `IBoardStore` defines the persistence contract.) Tj
T*
(- `JsonBoardStore` persists boards to disk as JSON.) Tj
T*
(- `BoardStorageOptions` holds persistence configuration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`wwwroot/index.html` is a lightweight static UI. It calls the API endpoints using) Tj
T*
(JavaScript.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`GameOfLife.Tests` contains unit and integration tests proving the rules, persistence,) Tj
T*
(API behavior, and UI serving.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
