T*
(API ENDPOINTS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The main endpoints are:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POST /boards) Tj
T*
(GET  /boards/{id}) Tj
T*
(GET  /boards/{id}/next) Tj
T*
(GET  /boards/{id}/states/{generations}) Tj
T*
(GET  /boards/{id}/final?maxAttempts=1000) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`POST /boards` uploads a new board and returns the board id.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`GET /boards/{id}` returns the original uploaded board.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`GET /boards/{id}/next` returns the next generation from the original uploaded board.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`GET /boards/{id}/states/{generations}` returns the board after a requested number of) Tj
T*
(generations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`GET /boards/{id}/final` attempts to find the final stable state. If the board does not) Tj
T*
(stabilize within `maxAttempts`, the API returns an error.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(REQUEST AND RESPONSE FORMAT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The API accepts either a readable row format:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
(  "rows": [) Tj
T*
(    ".....",) Tj
T*
(    "..#..",) Tj
T*
(    "..#..",) Tj
T*
(    "..#..",) Tj
T*
(    ".....") Tj
T*
(  ]) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Or a boolean matrix:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
(  "cells": [) Tj
T*
(    [false, false, false],) Tj
ET
endstream
