() Tj
T*
(LISKOV SUBSTITUTION PRINCIPLE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The endpoints depend on the `IBoardStore` interface. Any implementation of `IBoardStore`) Tj
T*
(should be usable by the API as long as it honors the same contract:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CreateAsync\(...\)) Tj
T*
(GetAsync\(...\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This allows `JsonBoardStore` to be replaced without changing the endpoint behavior.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(INTERFACE SEGREGATION PRINCIPLE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`IBoardStore` is intentionally small. It only exposes the operations the API needs:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Task<Guid> CreateAsync\(bool[][] cells, CancellationToken cancellationToken\);) Tj
T*
(Task<StoredBoard?> GetAsync\(Guid id, CancellationToken cancellationToken\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(It does not force unrelated methods like update, delete, search, or pagination.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(DEPENDENCY INVERSION PRINCIPLE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The API does not manually construct its dependencies inside each endpoint. Dependencies) Tj
T*
(are registered with .NET dependency injection:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(builder.Services.AddSingleton<GameOfLifeEngine>\(\);) Tj
T*
(builder.Services.AddSingleton<IBoardStore, JsonBoardStore>\(\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Then the endpoints receive services as parameters. This keeps the API layer loosely) Tj
T*
(coupled and easier to test.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(COMPLETENESS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The project includes tests for:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Conway's Game of Life rule behavior.) Tj
T*
(- Stable final state detection.) Tj
T*
(- JSON persistence across store instances.) Tj
T*
(- API upload behavior.) Tj
T*
(- Next-state behavior.) Tj
T*
(- Readable `rows` response format.) Tj
ET
endstream
